tion All Day 2021","artwork":"images/episodes/487-5-joe-kay.jpg","content":"**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2021 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set), [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set), [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set), and [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set).\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set) - Los Angeles 🇺🇸\n- [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set) - New York 🇺🇸\n- [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set) - Paris 🇫🇷\n\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2020](/episodes/all-day-2020/), or [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":28800,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-01-01T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"See Dee's Set","position":3}},{"id":"3_FEffK1HFE","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Lather","track":{"id":"GOO5zh056gw","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/lather/","slug":"lather","title":"Lather","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/lather.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"p1pSbRuL7vA","slug":"timeless-sounds-10-year-mix","tags":[6,6],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/us/room/1562052422"},"state":"published","title":"Timeless Sounds 10 Year Mix","artwork":"images/episodes/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix.jpg","content":"\n9 mixes from our heavy hitters. \nSounds from all over the world\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAired exclusively on Apple Music.\n\nJump to: \n\n- [Joe Kay](#joe-kay)\n- [Shaka Lion](#shaka-lion)\n- [JAEL](#jael)\n- [Andre Power](#andre-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":0,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:0