a.1636031802","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-559"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #559","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-559.jpg","content":"Souldies, samples, lovers' rock, and classics.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-07-30T08:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"QQ92KcBojmI","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - FAKE.PLAID","track":{"id":"ogU0R_hSbbE","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/fake-plaid/","slug":"fakeplaid","title":"FAKE.PLAID","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/fake-plaid.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PXQa1HxDvAg","slug":"136","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-136-w-astronautica/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #136 w/ Astronautica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"dgcm-cC2TsU","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Kmptble","track":{"id":"w_up0gnNIxQ","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/kmptble/","slug":"kmptble","title":"Kmptble","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xEj4AlSU7Es","slug":"137","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-137-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #137 w/ Mr. Carmack & Mikos Da Gawd","artwork":"/images/episodes/137.jpg","content":"\nMikos Da Gawd and Mr. Carmack each drop amazing sets of unreleased, original productions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe Kay kicked things off for the first half of the show! He dropped a lot of exclusives and forgotten gems. Mikos Da Gawd dropped a 30+ minute DJ set that consisted of many gems and original productions from the man himself. Mr. Carmack wrapped up the show with an amazing listening session of all of his latest unreleased works. Man, all we gotta say is that Carmack is one of the best in the game right now. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"x5LR-9yZcdE","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - 004","track":{"id":"UKTTxX62dOc","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/004/","slug":"004","title":"004","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/004.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xEj4AlSU7Es","slug":"137","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-137-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #137 w/ Mr. Carmack & Mikos Da Gawd","artwork":"/images/episodes/137.jpg","content":"\nMikos Da Gawd and Mr. Carmack each drop amazing sets of unreleased, original productions.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe Kay kicked things off for the first half of the show! He dropped a lot of exclusives and forgotten gems. Mikos Da Gawd dropped a 30+ minute DJ set that consisted of many gems and original productions from the man himself. Mr. Carmack wrapped up the show with an amazing listening session of all of his latest unreleased works. Man, all we gotta say is that Carmack is one of the best in the game right now. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-20T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"moPaEWTu6g4","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Flybutter (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"lOfohZ1nDBU","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/flybutter-instrumental/","slug":"flybutter-instrumental","title":"Flybutter (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/flybutter-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"T4jAG6V7-pU","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Fif Dim (single edit)","track":{"id":"J5w9rWnoRyc","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/fif-dim-single-edit/","slug":"fif-dim-single-edit","title":"Fif Dim (single edit)","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"xj9ohERACh8","slug":"153","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-153-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #153 w/ Dream Koala","artwork":"/images/episodes/153.jpg","content":"\nJoe Kay kicked things off with heavy, heavy vibes from many brand new/unheard artists and collectives. \n<!--more-->\n\nThe selection in here was really well thought out and analyzed properly so take notes.\n\nShouts to Geode and the Chord Marauders who sent over their forthcoming compilation which is simply amazing. Pay attention to these guys, trust. Also look out for Sunni Colòn & Jarreau Vandal. These two artists will be breakthrough artists on Soulection in 2014; guaranteed. We had special guest Dream Koala stop by who is visiting LA for his 1st time all the way from Berlin (current residence but originally from Paris). The young 19 year old threw down a DJ set that included bass and uptempo tribal vibes. In fact, his set was very different from his original production. Dream Koala is very talented and we look forward to see and hear what's to come. \n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10840,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-23T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"bLHOlASrg5M","position":56,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Butterflies (Mindesign's Flybutter Remix)","track":{"id":"2AqdyBB2RXI","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/butterflies-mindesign-s-flybutter-remix/","slug":"butterflies-mindesigns-flybutter-remix","title":"Butterflies (Mindesign's Flybutter Remix)","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/butterflies-mindesign-s-flybutter-remix.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-sYYcGUs9lE","position":88,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - slowdowntho","track":{"id":"vwnOFzXYagA","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/slowdowntho/","slug":"slowdowntho","title":"slowdowntho","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/slowdowntho.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"YVhCC2Enp-g","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Homewards","track":{"id":"N7t6MH9Z9xE","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/homewards/","slug":"homewards","title":"Homewards","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/homewards.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"7DDSwifOHik","position":16,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mndsgn - Camelblues","track":{"id":"_CfKuhPoQGA","path":"/artists/mndsgn/tracks/camelblues/","slug":"camelblues","title":"Camelblues","artist":{"slug":"mndsgn","title":"Mndsgn"},"artwork":"images/artists/mndsgn/tracks/camelblues.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kl47T3kNDKo","slug":"177","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-177-ft-dpat-siveys-live-set"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #177 Ft. (Dpat + Sivey's Live Set)","artwork":"/images/episodes/177.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFF